    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-20: secret scanning (gitleaks-based) adds ~8s to every warm sketch invocation regardless of whether source files have changed. UAT isolated this with `--no-secret-scan` differential: 15.8s baseline -> 7.5s without scan on alertmanager; 11.8s -> 3.6s on raft.tla (2 files). This is the dominant cost on small/medium repos and the sole cause of the '10-second floor'. Cache scan results keyed on file hashes — invalidate only when source files change."  # 659d
